          <a href="#curve-vs-motorised" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">5. Curve vs Motorised: A Real Decision</a>
          <a href="#buying-used" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">6. The Used Market Is the Real Route</a>
